    "text": "Men \u00fea leofestan, her saga\u00f0 an \u00feissum bocum ymbe \u00f0a miclan gewird \u00fee to \u00f0isse nihte wear\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ure\nAnd hit wear\u00f0 him cu\u00f0lice \u00e6tiwed \u00fe\u00e6t he swa wolde gedon.\n\u00de\u00e6t dioful is geciged and nemned Satanas, \u00fe\u00e6t is, ealdor deoful inwite.\nAnd he rixa\u00f0 and wuna\u00f0 in helle ny\u00feeweardre.\nVre Drihten astahg in \u00f0a helle to \u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fea halga saula \u00feanon generian.\nHit saga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea comon manige men to hellegatum, and \u00fea men w\u00e6ron atelice and swi\u00f0e la\u00f0lice\nAnd hit saga\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a men w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6re helle and \u00f0ara deofla geatweardas, \u00fe\u00e6t hi woldon \u00fea helle\nHer s\u00e6ge\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi wurdun hr\u00e6dlice afyrhtede, \u00fea ure Drihten com an \u00feas niht to \u00f0\u00e6re hellegatum, \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd he eode \u00fea in, ure Drihten, and br\u00e6c \u00fea helle and nerede \u00f0a halgan sawla \u00f0e an \u00f0an wite \u00e6r lange\nAnd hi w\u00e6ron \u00fea sprecende, \u00fea helware, him betwunum, and hi cw\u00e6don, Hw\u00e6t talia\u00f0 we hw\u00e6t \u00f0es\nTaliga\u00f0 we hw\u00e6\u00f0ere usse geatweardas slapen, \u00fea \u00f0es fyhtling in to us eode?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e taliga\u00f0 we hw\u00e6\u00f0er he h\u00e6bbe his ware gesette wi\u00f0 usne ordfruma?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e he hine ofslegene, and \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he into us eode?\n\u00de\u00e6t dioful gewat of \u00feisse helle feran to \u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t he Iudas gel\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t hi Crist on rodegealgan ahengon.\nAnd he git ne com, eala, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne wat hwilc w\u00e6l him is gerenod in \u00f0isse helle.\nAnd he \u00f0a, ure Drihten, astahg fur\u00f0ur in \u00fea helle mid his leohtes leoman, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he geseah hw\u00e6r Adam\nAnd he Adam w\u00e6s \u00fea sprecende and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hw\u00e6t taliga\u00f0 we hw\u00e6t \u00feis leoht sie \u00fee \u00feus h\u00e6dre scine\u00f0 on\nHi w\u00e6ron \u00f0a sprecende, \u00fea helware, him betweonum and hi cw\u00e6don, Hw\u00e6t is \u00f0es scinenda and \u00fees\nYfele we sindon her in gebegane.\nHw\u00e6t, we nu w\u00e6ron f\u00e6gne, \u00fe\u00e6t we us moston bediglan on ussum scr\u00e6fum, \u00fe\u00e6t he us ne swencte mid\nHw\u00e6t, we witon \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre \u00e6r ne w\u00e6s n\u00e6nig to \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feristig \u00fe\u00e6t he lifigende into us eode.\nTaliga\u00f0 we hw\u00e6\u00feere he heonon hworfe butan usse wrace?\nHw\u00e6t, we witon \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre \u00e6r in middangeard \u00f0y lic we ne gesawun on ure h\u00e6lo, ne nefre \u00e6r \u00feus\nHw\u00e6t, we gehyra\u00f0 and geseo\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0eos arlease sini\u00f0\u00fee is adumbud, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00feeos hel and \u00f0as wito\nHw\u00e6t, we gesio\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees scinenda is to \u00f0an hider cyme, \u00fe\u00e6t he nere\u00f0 \u00feas saula.\nHe reafa\u00f0 \u00feas helle, ne wile he her wunian mid us on \u00feissum wite.\nAnd her s\u00e6ge\u00f0 eft \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea helware \u00feus reonodon \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t ordfremme folc and \u00fe\u00e6t geswencede werod.\nAdam and his cyn hi feollon to ures dne foton and wependum wordum hi cw\u00e6don, Drihten, genere us\n\u00d0a se stranga wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne stranga ger\u00e6sde, \u00fea ure Drihten acom and \u00fe\u00e6t ealdor dioful geband and tr\u00e6d\nAnd ure dne nam \u00fea Adam be his handa and teah hine up of \u00fe\u00e6re helle and ealle \u00f0a halgan saula \u00fee\nAnd on \u00f0\u00e6ne d\u00e6g, \u00f0e nu tod\u00e6g is, micelne here \u00feara halegra saula he l\u00e6dde mid him up of \u00f0\u00e6re helle\nSwi\u00f0e us is \u00f0onne to ge\u00feencanne, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se writtere, nu men \u00f0a leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t ure Drihten hafa\u00f0 eft\nHe si\u00fea\u00f0, ure Drihten, on \u00feisne middangeard, mid micelre egesan cyme\u00f0.\nSunne and monan \u00feistria\u00f0, and steorran fealla\u00f0 on eor\u00f0an, and hefenas beo\u00f0 gefealdene swa o\u00f0ere bec.\nAnd he sende\u00f0 \u00feenne, ure Drihten, his engelas feower, and hi blawa\u00f0 feower byman \u00e6t feower sceatum\n\u00deonne si\u00fean \u00fea byman geblawen habba\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre fis ne fugel ne w\u00e6ter ne wilde dyor ne fyr, ne ne\n\u00d0onne seo saul and se lichama byo\u00f0 gegadrode, and hi arisa\u00f0 \u00feonne up of \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an and ga\u00f0 for\u00f0 to\nAnd sit ure dne on his heahsetle, and he hafa\u00f0 his rode him an handa, and hio lyhte\u00f0 ofer ealne \u00feisne\nAnd \u00fea wunda byo\u00f0 swa opena and swa nywe swa hi w\u00e6ron \u00fey d\u00e6ge \u00fee he Iudas an his lichaman\nFyr byrne\u00f0 beforan Drihtenes heahsetle, and eall manna cyn sceal byrnan on \u00feam fyre, \u00e6r hi to \u00f0am\nOnd \u00feonne Godes engelas ar\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00e6lces mannes worc, swa god swa yfel, swa hi \u00e6r gewyrht habba\u00f0.\nHi standa\u00f0, \u00fea men, \u00e6t \u00feam dome \u00fee him her nu \u00f0a ne hira\u00f0, ne his larae ne gima\u00f0.\nHi bio\u00f0 swi\u00f0e beofiende and wepende, and hira weor\u00f0ung \u00fe\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 \u00fee mare \u00fee her on worulde \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00dea deman and \u00f0a ealdormen \u00feenu earmra manna \u00e6hta nidinga nima\u00f0 and gegripa\u00f0, hi sworcetta\u00fe and\nAnd hi sw\u00e6ta\u00f0 blode, and him \u00fe\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6nig cl\u00e6nnis seald, ne r\u00e6ft.\n\u00d0\u00e6t la bi\u00f0 se bitera d\u00e6g and se strange d\u00e6g.\n\u00de\u00e6t la bi\u00f0 bealluis d\u00e6g and biman d\u00e6g, cyrmes d\u00e6g and cerfulnesse d\u00e6g.\n\u00de\u00e6t la bi\u00f0 nearonesse d\u00e6g and earfo\u00f0nysse d\u00e6g.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6t la bi\u00f0 se bifenda domes d\u00e6g eallum mannum to gebidanne.\nHi ga\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00f0a Godes engelas and asceada\u00f0 \u00fea gedefan saula fram \u00fean synfulum, and hi setta\u00f0 gode\nAnd he hwyrf\u00fe hine \u00feonne on \u00fea wynstran, ure dne, and he bi\u00f0 \u00feonne sprecende to eallum \u00fean\nAnd he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala, \u00feai man, hw\u00e6t, ic \u00f0e geworhte minum handum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu were me sylfum to\nIc \u00fee gesta\u00f0olode on neorsnawanges wuldure, \u00fea \u00f0u mine \u00f0am leoflican bebodu forhogodest and \u00feu\nAn \u00feane folga\u00f0 \u00feu forworhtest, \u00fee ic \u00fee ansende, and awearp of \u00f0an wuldre to dea\u00f0e.\n\u00d0a ic me geea\u00f0medde to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t ic gesohte f\u00e6mnanede lichaman inno\u00f0, and ic w\u00e6s geboren \u00feurh\nAnd me man swang mid swipan, and \u00feyrnenne helm man sette on min heafod, and ic let mine sidun\nLoca nu and geseoh \u00feara wunda swa\u00f0e and \u00feara n\u00e6gla dolh \u00fee min lichama w\u00e6s mid \u00feurhdrifen.\nEal \u00feas sar ic ge\u00f0rowode for \u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6r ic tilode \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu an hefenum rixsode.\nFor hwan, la man, ferlur \u00feu \u00feis eall \u00f0e ic for \u00f0e ge\u00ferowode, and f\u00e6r hwan feng \u00feu un\u00f0anc?\nHwa wat \u00fea seminga ic nu leng be minum dea\u00f0e ne sprece?\nAgif me \u00fein lif for\u00fean ic min lif f\u00e6r \u00f0e sealde.\nFor hwan besmite \u00feu me mid \u00feinum synnum, and \u00fe\u00e6t templ \u00fee ic me sylfum gehalgode?\n\u00dea sealdest \u00feu diofolle hus \u00fe\u00e6r ic me restan \u00feohte.\nFar hwan bescridest \u00feu \u00f0e nu to d\u00e6g heofona rices gefean?\nMe w\u00e6s sio rod \u00feinra synna micele hefigra \u00feonne me w\u00e6re sio rod \u00fee ic on acweald w\u00e6s.\nIc cwe\u00f0e nu to eow, gewita\u00f0 ge awirgede fram me in \u00fe\u00e6t ecce fyr.\nAnd ic eow betyne to d\u00e6g heofona rices duru togeanes, swa ge betyndon eowra dura togenes \u00feearfum\nNelle ic gehiran to d\u00e6g eowre stefne \u00fee ma \u00f0e ge woldon gehiran \u00fe\u00e6s earman stefne.\nHi fo\u00f0 \u00feonne, \u00fea deoflo, to \u00f0an saulum and l\u00e6da\u00f0 into helle.\n\u00d0onne arist Sancta Maria and hio g\u00e6\u00f0 for\u00f0 and hio annih\u00f0 to ussum H\u00e6lende, and hio bide\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he\nAnd he alife\u00f0 hire, and hio g\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feonne and asc\u00e6t\u00f0 \u00feane \u00feriddan d\u00e6l \u00feara saula and geset gode on \u00fea\n\u00deonne arist Sanctus Michael and he g\u00e6\u00f0 for\u00f0 and he nih\u00f0 to ussum H\u00e6lende, and he bid \u00fe\u00e6t he him\nAnd he alife\u00f0 him, and he g\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feonne and sc\u00e6t\u00f0 \u00feane \u00feriddan d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6ra saula, geset gode on swi\u00f0ran\n\u00d0onne arist Sanctus Petrus and he g\u00e6\u00f0 for\u00f0 and he nih\u00f0 to ussum Drihten, and he bit \u00fe\u00e6t he him\nAnd he alyfe\u00f0 him, and he g\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feonne and asc\u00e6t\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00ferid d\u00e6l \u00f0ara saula and geset gode on \u00f0a\nAnd nima\u00f0 \u00feanne \u00fea deofolo \u00f0a lafe and l\u00e6da\u00f0 to helle, and he g\u00e6\u00fe \u00feonne \u00e6fter, Sanctus Petrus, and\nHe wyrf\u00f0 hine \u00f0anne, ure Drihten, on \u00fea swi\u00f0ran healfe to \u00f0an gedefum mannum.\nAnd he cwi\u00f0, \u00fea me hingrede, \u00fea sealde ge me mete.\n\u00dea me \u00feyrste, \u00f0a sealde ge me drincan.\n\u00dea ic w\u00e6s nacod, \u00fea gyredige me.\n\u00dea ic \u00e6l\u00f0iodig w\u00e6s, \u00fea anfengon ge min.\n\u00dea ic w\u00e6s untrum, \u00fea fandode ge min.\nAnd hi \u00feonne cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, dne, hwanne w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6s byhofodes?\nAnd him \u00feonne andswara\u00f0 ure Drihten and cwi\u00f0, \u00feonne ge sealdon \u00f0an earman \u00feonne afeng ic \u00fe\u00e6re\nAnd he arise\u00f0 ure Drihten of \u00f0an dome, and he fere\u00f0 \u00feonne uppe to hefenum and \u00f0a ealle mid him \u00f0e\nAnd se Drihten lifa\u00f0 and ricsa\u00fe mid feder and mid suna and mid \u00fean halgan gaste a worulda, a\nAmen.",
